  "notes": "Announced as Gemini Pro, one of three sizes of Gemini 1.0; the Bard-to-Gemini post calls it Pro 1.0. The original API id gemini-pro is kept as a candidate alias because later aliases such as gemini-pro-latest point to newer models. Retirement: the Gemini API stopped supporting it on 2025-02-18; Vertex AI retired gemini-1.0-pro-001 and gemini-1.0-pro-002 (released there on 2024-04-09) on 2025-04-21. No lineage to PaLM 2 is stated by Google, so no predecessor relation."
